<title>USA: Napa Valley USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</title>
<headline>Napa Valley USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Sec. said it won $4.600 million of Napa Valley USD, Calif., election of 1996 general obligation bonds, Series B, with a net interest cost of 5.19 percent.</p>
</text>
